        "content": "# Moderation Prefix Guide\nUse `{prefix}[command]` to moderate users quickly.\n\n### Commands & Shortcuts:\n- `ban`: Ban a user\n- `softban` / `sb`: Kick + delete messages\n- `kick` / `kk`: Kick a user\n- `timeout` / `to`: Timeout a user\n- `unban` / `uban`: Unban a user\n- `untimeout` / `uto`: Remove timeout\n\n### How to use:\n- **Standard**: `{prefix}timeout @user 1d Reason`\n- **Fuzzy**: `{prefix}timeout Aleks 1d Reason` (Shows a menu if multiple matches)\n- **Reply**: Reply to a message with `{prefix}timeout 1d Reason` to target that user.\n\n### Tips:\n- Time units: `s`, `m`, `h`, `d`, `w` (e.g. `3d` = 3 days).\n- You can use User IDs instead of mentions."
